        "text": ";; Copyright (c) Rich Hickey. All rights reserved.\n;; The use and distribution terms for this software are covered by the\n;; Eclipse Public License 1.0 (http://opensource.org/licenses/eclipse-1.0.php)\n;; which can be found in the file epl-v10.html at the root of this distribution.\n;; By using this software in any fashion, you are agreeing to be bound by\n;; the terms of this license.\n;; You must not remove this notice, or any other, from this software.\n\n(ns cljs.invoke-test\n  (:require [goog.string :as gstr]))\n\n(defn variadic-fn [& args])\n\n(variadic-fn 1 2 3)\n\n(defn multi-fn\n  ([a] a)\n  ([a b] a))\n\n(defn hof-fn-expr-should-be-bound\n  [funexpr0 normal-arg]\n  ((complement funexpr0) normal-arg))\n\n(defn hof-arg-should-be-bound\n  [hofinvoke inv-arg0]\n  (hofinvoke (inv-arg0)))\n\n(defn hof-fn-expr+args-should-be-bound\n  [funexpr1 inv-arg1]\n  ((complement funexpr1) (inv-arg1)))\n\n;; A keyword should not be bound in a let:\n(def foo (delay\n           (:dont-bind-this js/x)))\n\n(multi-fn 2)\n\n(gstr/urlEncode \"foo\")\n\n(js/goog.string.urlDecode \"bar\")\n\n(declare ^{:arglists '([a b])} declared-fn)\n\n(declared-fn 1 2)\n\n(defrecord Foo [foo-field-a foo-field-b])\n\n(def foo-record (->Foo 1 2))\n\n(:foo-field-a foo-record)\n"
      },
      "disposition": "unrelated",
      "category": "upstream-internals",
      "reason": "The unchanged complete module is the exact source fixture consumed by the original JVM test-optimized-invoke-emit with :static-fns true. All eleven original predicates inspect generated JS spelling, optimized dispatch slots, temporary bindings or direct record field access. The module deliberately invokes an uninitialized declared-fn before its record tail; it has no exported callback or public runtime test harness. Its three higher-order functions are emission-shape subjects and are not executed by the original program. Generated JS spelling and optimizer shape are outside the adopted compiler API goals. Every independent public call/IFn/record/declare/keyword obligation remains intended; no semantic or phase pass is supplied here.",
